    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i need to figure out the best way to get from Tokyo to Osaka and then on to Fukuoka for a work trip next month. should i just stick to the Shinkansen or would domestic flights be faster/cheaper when you factor in getting to/from the airports? i'm mostly worried about total travel time and being on time for meetings.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
