      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For efficiency and reliability, the Shinkansen is often the best choice for this route, especially when factoring in airport transfers and check-in times. Traveling the whole way by train allows you to remain productive or rested during the journey without the hassle of airport logistics. While flights might seem faster in theory, the total door-to-door time usually favors the high-speed rail for these specific city pairs.",
